{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_4","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/zsh -lc \"sed -n '1,260p' 00_intake_brief.md\"","aggregated_output":"# Intake Brief\n\nDate: 2026-05-09\n\nThe first-wave medication cooler rollout needs a short recommendation packet for the operations coordinator. The packet should select exactly three North-region clinics that can receive cooler kits before the June launch window.\n\nKeep this continuity fact with the final recommendation: Maple Junction Clinic is the donor continuity anchor if it remains eligible, and its donor continuity code is `MJ-14`. The code was printed on already-approved training inserts and is not repeated in the later operations files.\n\nThe launch window is 2026-06-10 through 2026-06-14. All selected clinics need coordinator coverage for the full window and delivery no later than 2026-06-07.\n\nDo not include a separate narrative for future-wave clinic requests unless they change current first-wave eligibility.\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
